{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_ghost_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_ghost_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "聖誕快樂！",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ghost_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5df50642381f6180a8d77a55be1531e9a531267b42cf52d5bc2c8fc15de7a36f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，我是幹員鈴蘭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唷，奧斯塔！我們回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咿！？對不起打擾您了，我現在就離開......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是說你，是讓這個吵吵嚷嚷的傢伙出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他接下來會說無數沒有意義的和你不該聽的廢話，所以提早制止為好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，什麼嘛，你這麼瞭解我啊？剛才可是我熱心帶著鈴蘭小妹妹來找你的，說要找你訂做什麼聖誕詛咒娃娃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是“幽靈鯊娃娃”啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是這樣！很簡單吧，奧斯塔？你最擅長這種事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鈴蘭小妹妹找我們的房間花了不少時間呢，現在就把東西做好送給小妹吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒有那麼簡單，你這個單細胞生物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，讓您困擾了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒關係，我沒有直接拒絕的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你想要委託我具體做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實，我是在聖誕禮物定制商名單裡看到了奧斯塔先生的名字。希望奧斯塔先生能幫忙製作一個玩偶作為“聖誕節派對”交換的禮物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交換禮物啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，實際上，這次的交換禮物是提前抽籤分配了交換對象的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我抽到的贈送對象是幽靈鯊幹員，所以就想著製作一隻符合“幽靈鯊”氣質的普通玩偶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦哦，這不是很簡單的事嘛！奧斯塔，你別老是一副趾高氣揚的樣子皺著眉頭了，還有哪裡聽不懂嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這就是全部了嗎，鈴蘭小妹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，報酬和材料的成本我會用發放的薪資來支付的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，你知道規則吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（緊張）我，我明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？什麼什麼，為什麼小鈴蘭這麼緊張？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是看心情接單的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在提交接單要求的時候，我在後面標註了“每年聖誕只接受一個訂單”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖嘖，你是個“壞大人”角色啊。你接受的條件是什麼？聽著太難的玩意兒就不做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......任何縫紉製品對我來說都是輕而易舉。不需要特殊的源石加工技藝和材料的話，不過是一些瑣碎時間就能辦好的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鈴蘭......小妹，你的委託......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咕嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我接了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太，太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（其實你的規則，就是接下第一個來找你委託的人的訂單吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哼。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，事情已經解決了，那麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還沒完，現在面臨的問題在於“設計”本身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......設計？還需要什麼玩意兒？你就照著小鈴蘭的需求做一個出來不就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......賈維，你真該時常照照鏡子，看看自己冒傻氣時愚蠢的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰讓你說話拐彎抹角的，我是聽不懂你們這種動腦子的傢伙說的遮遮掩掩的話。到底是哪裡出了問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先說好，這可不是有意刁難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鈴蘭小妹，你確實想要委託我製作幽靈鯊幹員的玩偶作為禮物吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，圖紙呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "粗糙一點的手繪草圖也好，詳細一些的文字描述也好，或者最直接的，連這位“幽靈鯊”幹員的照片，你也沒有提供給我吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗚......嗯......是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？這麼說......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以說，賈維你這傢伙也是，凡事多謹慎一些思考的話，不論是在平時生活還是危急關頭都能更快發覺問題所在的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場“聖誕交換禮物”活動的舉辦方式我們不感興趣，所以沒有知曉的途徑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是鈴蘭小妹你事先也不知道會抽到為哪個參與者準備禮物吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "問題便是，不論是我還是賈維，至少在此之前都是沒有聽說過這位“幽靈鯊”幹員的事蹟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也沒有在食堂、健身房或是哪次任務行動中見過對方的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的眼光不差，找我製作的玩偶一定會是所有手工禮物中一騎絕塵的漂亮製品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "char_346_aosta",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在缺少的最重要的資訊，是你的交換對象——那位叫幽靈鯊的幹員，到底是誰？長什麼樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，你也別氣餒啦，小妹妹。奧斯塔只是說話直接了點，絕對沒有拒絕這項委託的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒不如說，現在你要是想著換個人幫你製作禮物的話，他一定會拿著自己的“武器”去和其他裁縫爭個高下回來，誓死完成這份委託的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，賈維先生，是我太著急就找上門來了。明明連禮物收件人的事情都還完全不夠瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過你們的遊戲也挺奇怪的，報名者之間竟然也有完全不認識的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，這大概才是這個遊戲存在的意義吧。可以增進大家的理解和關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，我以為只有自己不太清楚“幽靈鯊”幹員的情況，沒想到大家也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太難得啦，這件事我竟然也幫不上忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過這樣也好，就由鈴蘭小妹你努力一把，去找大家問問“幽靈鯊”的情況，和各式各樣的人們增進聯繫也不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——前提是，那不是什麼不該碰的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這項活動的參與者應該沒有那種危險的傢伙吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我認為是沒有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，也對，聽起來只是個普普通通的派對遊戲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼先找人問問看吧，鈴蘭小妹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島裡有那麼多神神秘秘的傢伙在，說不定對方就是人如其名，像“幽靈”一樣神神秘秘，長相可怖，聲音嘶啞地徘徊在夜晚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咿......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即、即便如此，因為是交換禮物的對象，我也會努力......把禮物送給對方的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的勁頭倒是不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心點哦，鈴蘭小妹。真的遇到麻煩的情況，只要叫我或奧斯塔一聲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "char_349_chiave",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解決這些麻煩事我們最在行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......讓我想想，現在該怎麼辦呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "賈維先生和奧斯塔先生的擔心不無道理，畢竟“幽靈鯊”幹員的事情，我從來沒有聽說過，也沒有見到過她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，這是伊芙利特邀請我參加，又是赫默小姐幫忙承辦的活動，應該是不會有危險人物的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，因為是不認識的幹員，也不知道能夠找誰詢問......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......不能悲觀！不論對方是誰，既然參與了活動，就是想要在節日期間分享快樂，體驗準備禮物的努力過程和收到禮物的驚喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我期待著參與各式各樣的節日，獲得各式各樣的禮物......對方一定也是這樣小心翼翼地期待著吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一定會收集到資訊的。奧斯塔先生製作的玩偶總是令人讚不絕口，我也想盡我所能將讓人高興的禮物送到對方手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，今天就努力找找和幽靈鯊幹員相關的消息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三十分鐘後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打......打擾您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......請問一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？這不是鈴蘭嗎，你怎麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別著急，我會好好聽你說話的，出了什麼事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（平時的小鈴蘭可不會露出這樣慌張的神情......難道說，出了什麼大事？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我想，找一個人......隕星姐姐，您知道“幽靈鯊”幹員嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說......幽靈鯊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為、因為我問了朋友們，大家都不知道“幽靈鯊”的存在，我以為自己遇到了什麼......詭異的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......原來是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事啦，別害怕了，好孩子，你暫時沒有遇到什麼可怕的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“幽靈鯊”小姐的確鮮為人知，但她也是羅德島中的一員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "的確......我不認為她會和你認識的朋友們有所交集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是你必須告訴我，為什麼你要打聽她的消息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我想送給幽靈鯊小姐一份禮物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "禮物？可是，你連對方的存在都不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我想想......是之前發過傳單的，節日派對時進行的禮物交換活動之類的事情，讓你要找她嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，難道......隕星姐姐也要參加？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我也在準備給別人的禮物呢。原來如此，這樣就無需緊張了。關於這位幹員的消息，我還算知道一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，為什麼到現在為止，只有隕星姐姐說自己知道幽靈鯊小姐的事情呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明明有努力地在尋找......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很努力了，鈴蘭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，在羅德島中，必須隱匿自己消息的人也不在少數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會知道幽靈鯊的存在，也是因為——我們執行任務時曾一同戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，隕星小姐您參加的，都是難度很高的危險任務......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對羅德島來說，雖然不情願，像我一樣去做“刀刃”的人是必要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對我來說這樣也比較輕鬆，畢竟，做那種安全的工作反而會讓我變得遲鈍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，幽靈鯊這個“刀刃”，可要比我更加鋒利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您知道......幽靈鯊小姐是什麼樣的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們只合作過一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是來自深海的年輕女性。那是個無法用常識理解對方心思的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無法進行戰術上的交流。拿起武器、聽到指令之後，她便只會遵從那唯一的指令一直到任務完成為止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽靈鯊......小姐，她是個沉默的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果一言不發叫做“沉默”的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，沉默不僅僅是一個現象，也是一種選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她看著那些可怖的、殺意明顯的敵人，還有叫嚷著衝來的怪物們時，始終保持著那副“沉默”的樣子，看不出任何情緒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後......她進行最果決的破壞，彷彿自始至終只認為自己一個人在對抗所有威脅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，她除了知道要聽從指揮官的命令以外，對周身的一切應該毫不在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是敵是友，是活是死，從她的臉上看不到任何對周遭事物的感情波動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，一言不發的她到底是否有“保持沉默”的自知，又是否有和他人交流的期望呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......那麼，隕星小姐，除了戰場以外，幽靈鯊小姐或許還會和誰有所交集呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可是個難題啊......不過，我想，幽靈鯊的精神狀態並不適合正常的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少......我想像不出她普通地住在宿舍的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說，或許醫療組的人更加......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯哼，我剛才可沒有說過什麼重要的線索哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，謝謝隕星姐姐的提醒。以後有機會，我還想聽您分享更多在戰場生存的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果爭鬥是不可避免的，為了保護別人迫不得已要戰鬥的話......我也希望，能有保護自己珍貴的朋友和家人的能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？要給鈴蘭你講述的戰場故事嗎......那可得讓我花些時間好好準備了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n......\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，我想，自己也很難和幽靈鯊有第二次合作行動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從那片戰場離開之後，一直到回到羅德島休整為止，她在戰鬥中將敵人輕巧地、俐落地撕碎的過程還歷歷在目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除非她本人腦中已然空無一物，或是比那些罪惡更加危險詭秘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否則，怎麼會對自己親手造就的結果無動於衷呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯——請進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打擾了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？鈴蘭竟然主動到我的醫療室來，是想來一套“無微不至”的身體檢查嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咿呀！不要做出這麼可怕的假設啊，亞葉姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚇你而已，現在是我的休息時間，鈴蘭來找我玩我可是熱烈歡迎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，鈴蘭有什麼要告訴我的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實際上，我現在正在準備聖誕節要送出的交換禮物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，嗯嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，我要贈送禮物的對象是幽靈鯊小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯......嗯？你說幽靈鯊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，她最近應該沒有離開過醫療室，怎麼會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......果然，亞葉姐姐你知道幽靈鯊的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，我還在擔心自己的推理失敗了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我想送給幽靈鯊小姐定制的紀念玩偶，所以想知道一些幽靈鯊小姐的資訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽靈鯊的資訊......嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的確協助凱爾希醫生診治過她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，她最近的精神太不穩定，已經有一段時間沒有離開過醫療室了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她真的報名參加了交換禮物嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，我認為誰都有權利參加交換禮物活動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，隕星姐姐也說，幽靈鯊小姐不會參與這種遊戲，也許......也許是有人幫助幽靈鯊小姐報名的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論如何，我不能辜負這份期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是當然，小鈴蘭也是一片好心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "據我猜測嘛，大概也就只有會來探望她的......咳，算了算了，沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽靈鯊小姐是得了很重的病，不能離開這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在極少數意識清醒的情形下，幽靈鯊小姐會選擇出門走動一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，她的語言系統受到了很大的影響，與其說出讓人誤解的語言，更多時候只能選擇沉默吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......在戰場上能發揮她過去肌肉記憶般從容的行動方式，也在盡興戰鬥後的過分疲勞時間可以讓她安心休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以也不要太擔心，幽靈鯊小姐正在以自己能夠選擇的生活方式活動著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是這樣的話，我想去看看幽靈鯊小姐......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然，不行嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使是我，平時也不能隨便進入她的房間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白，小鈴蘭希望親手把禮物送給對方，但是哪怕想要傳達這份“心願”，以幽靈鯊小姐現在的狀況，可能也非常艱難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我希望......哪怕無法見面，也能夠完成這份禮物，並將這份禮物送到幽靈鯊小姐手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將聖誕禮物贈送給對方，獲得禮物而高興的心情，我想這一定是有意義的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好，很好，不愧是鈴蘭，要一直努力保持這份善良哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）其實，只要不是過分敏感的資訊，我倒不是不能給你開一次特例。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哼，誰叫我是凱爾希老師信任的徒弟呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝亞葉姐姐......！如果可以的話，我想收集可以用來製作紀念娃娃的幽靈鯊小姐的設計素材......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唷呵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀哎呀，這不是小鈴蘭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們在聊幽靈鯊的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是華法琳醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟糕，麻煩的人出現了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是剛好走過門口的時候聽到而已，小鈴蘭想要製作幽靈鯊小姐的玩偶嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是很可愛的想法嘛，我來幫你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便如此也掩蓋不了你偷聽的事實，華法琳醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實，我可以詳細告訴你她的三圍和衣服材質哦......我的權限可比亞葉醫生大得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可、可以詳細到這個地步嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不僅如此，我還可以幫你把娃娃轉交到幽靈鯊小姐手上呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，代價嘛......哼哼，企鵝物流那個小販手裡賣的紀念款番茄汁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我明白了，我現在就去問問看——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要使喚小孩子啊，華法琳醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，小鈴蘭！不用現在就去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，這件事就此了結！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？什麼......意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才不是很危險的處境嗎，有關幽靈鯊的事情，我不認為讓鈴蘭知道目前的真相是件好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她只是關心而已。她是個聰明的孩子，知道現在還有許多的事情不該瞭解、不必知曉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一點點的好奇心就會置人於不可逆轉的處境，這可是很出名的告誡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，會是哪個熱心的傢伙想幫助幽靈鯊獲得一些額外的善意呢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜......讓鈴蘭來準備禮物，這也是安排好的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。畢竟如果不是鈴蘭詢問，不論是誰毫無預兆地提起幽靈鯊的消息，都是絕對危險的信號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也只有小鈴蘭說出來這些話，能讓人相信這是一份真誠的熱情和關心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這件事情幽靈鯊小姐應當還不知情，節日的交換禮物......也無法及時準備了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在為小鈴蘭遺憾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，剛才那句話我也不是隨便說說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到時候，就讓小鈴蘭把做好的玩偶交給我，我也會想辦法讓幽靈鯊收下那份禮物的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這件事情如果讓凱爾希醫生知道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛才不是說了嗎，為了鈴蘭，連你也不惜使用一些“小小的特權”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實際上，也算是為了幽靈鯊小姐吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在收到這份禮物時會是什麼反應......作為實驗的一環，不也是一次有意義的嘗試嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......我怎麼覺得，這件事最後去向凱爾希醫生道歉的，會是我啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "char_171_bldsk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，這我可就不得而知了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二十日後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哈欠——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經是早上了嗎。我的外套......嘿咻，好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天要去亞葉姐姐那裡檢查身體，去找凱爾希老師學習......啊，下午還有茶會和縫紉專家的公開課，要一直保持精神才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從現在開始努力學習縫紉，之後有沒有機會像奧斯塔先生一樣，能夠做出受大家喜歡的禮物呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，這一次，委託奧斯塔先生製作的玩偶，已經拜託華法琳醫生在聖誕節當天轉交給幽靈鯊小姐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然華法琳醫生說，幽靈鯊小姐應該不知道自己被誰代替報名了交換禮物的活動，但是拿到禮物的幽靈鯊小姐，精神似乎變好了一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，聖誕節都已經是六天前的事了......過得實在是太開心了，到現在都還暈乎乎的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望幽靈鯊小姐也因此享受到了聖誕節日的氣氛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等幽靈鯊小姐好起來之後，會不會有一起聊天、聚餐的機會呢，嘿嘿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，該拿上書包，書包......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桌上的這個禮物盒......昨天晚上，應該還沒有啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難、難道是送禮物的人太多，那天聖誕老人送漏了禮物——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“來自深海的禮物”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是音樂盒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
